    <briefdescription>
<para>A single entry in the Raft log. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each log entry contains:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>term: The term when the entry was created by the leader</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>index: The position of the entry in the log (1-indexed)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>command: The actual command/data to be replicated</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>timestamp_ns: <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_true_time" kindref="compound">TrueTime</ref> timestamp in nanoseconds since epoch </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
